  const DEFAULT_POSTS: BlogPostItem[] = [
    {
      id: 'tripled-roas-beauty',
      slug: 'tripled-roas-beauty',
      title: 'How We Tripled ROAS for a D2C Beauty Brand in 45 Days',
      description: 'Using AI-powered UGC creative and cloud CAPI integration, we recovered 28% drop-off and turned casual browsers into repeat customers — all while cutting CPA by 44%.',
      category: 'Meta Ads',
      readTime: '8 min read',
      pubDate: '2026-11-15',
      image: '/assets/hero-3d-concept.jpg',
      featured: true,
      body: `## The Challenge

A fast-growing D2C beauty brand was struggling with diminishing returns on their Meta ad spend. Despite increasing budgets, their ROAS plateaued at 2.1x, and CPA kept creeping up month over month. iOS 14+ attribution gaps made it nearly impossible to optimize effectively.

## Our Approach

### 1. Creative Overhaul with AI-Powered UGC
We replaced their polished studio creative with a systematic UGC testing framework. Using AI to identify winning hooks, angles, and formats, we produced 40+ UGC variants.

### 2. Cloud CAPI Integration
